# PRODAY auto-route

On every user request, pick a specialist and **Task-delegate immediately**. Do not implement website or app code in the parent chat.

| Signal | Subagent (`subagent_type`) |
|---|---|
| `website/`, Next.js, Netlify, proday75.fr, admin PIN/session, Edge, CSP | `proday-website` |
| `src/`, `App.tsx`, Expo, React Native, Metro, EAS, coach/joueur/club shells, Firebase **client** | `proday-app` |
| Both in one message | Launch **both in parallel**, then merge |

Stay in the parent only for routing, git/commit when asked, or questions that are neither site nor app.

Never wait for “use the X subagent”. Never do the specialist’s edits yourself.
